mission "The Long Blue Road"
    name "The Long Blue Road"
    description "Carry the deserter and his statement to Magistrate Ortez at Blackwater Reach."
    source "Pelican's Rest"
    destination "Blackwater Reach"
    reward 470
    speaker offer "Commodore Anne Bonny"
    speaker visit "Commodore Anne Bonny"
    speaker complete "Commodore Anne Bonny"
    to offer
        has "A Signal at Pelican Point: done"
    on offer
        conversation
            `The deserter will only testify before a magistrate beyond the Company patrols.`
            `Tomas recommends Blackwater Reach, a busy river port in the Leeward Expanse. Its magistrate once prosecuted illegal prize-taking and may still be trusted.`
            `The voyage is long and crosses open water. There are no friendly islands between the Windward Reach and the Leeward Expanse; watch the weather and use the oars when the wind falls.`
            choice
                `(I will take this voyage. Tell me the course.)`
                    goto accept_job
                `(What makes this business so important?)`
                    goto more_details
                `(I have other waters to sail.)`
                    goto decline_job
            label more_details
                `The voyage is long and crosses open water. There are no friendly islands between the Windward Reach and the Leeward Expanse; watch the weather and use the oars when the wind falls.`
                choice
                    `(Then I will see it done.)`
                        goto accept_job
                    `(Not this time.)`
                        goto decline_job
            label accept_job
                `The paymaster boards with a sea chest and two witnesses. “I sold powder to men who called themselves merchants. I would rather face a court than see another village burned.”`
                accept
            label decline_job
                `The officer nods and rolls the chart closed. The offer will remain here if you change your mind.`
                close
    on accept
        log "Accepted The Long Blue Road. Carry the deserter and his statement to Magistrate Ortez at Blackwater Reach."
    on visit
        conversation
            `Magistrate Ortez takes the statement under seal. He says the Company has bought forts along the Leeward Expanse and is preparing to control the western convoy routes.`
    on complete
        conversation
            `Ortez asks you to meet his harbour pilot at San Telmo.`
        log "Completed The Long Blue Road. Received 470 gold. Ortez asks you to meet his harbour pilot at San Telmo."
